{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cheater\u2019s Table</strong> is a mafia-themed card game of deception and survival.<br>At this table, everyone can cheat. But just one survives...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart rivals in tense matches where cheating is as important as the cards in your hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer PvP</strong> \u2013 Challenge friends or strangers in online matches where cheating is part of the rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Cheat Mechanics</strong> \u2013 Hide joker cards, bait opponents, and call their bluffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Noir Visuals</strong> \u2013 Dark, cinematic environments that immerse you in the tension of the table.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn</strong> \u2013 Inspired by classic card games, but with a deadly twist.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3951810?t=1769148356","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/c45cf5f3dacb59a9e02e658b7c7966f79b670470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769148356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/505807f6677dadb5393f21a00e3f8eecbce41bbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769148356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3951810/505807f6677dadb5393f21a00e3f8eecbce41bbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769148356","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of cri